TEXT 240 -80 Left 2 ;Computation: 550Hz Filter\nf=50\nVLL=400kV/50Hz V0=VLL/sqrt(3)=231kV\nQB=50(30-60) Filter quality factor\nQF=73.3MVar (Filter reactive power at 50Hz)\nh=11 (harmonics)\nfh=h*f=550\nQF600=QF/fh=6.6MVar\nXC=3*V0*V0/QF600=24000\nC=1/omega/XC=132.6nF\nL=1/(2*%pi*fh)^2/C=0.631H\nXL=2*%pi*fh*L=2182\nC50=C*h=1.46u\nL50=L/h=0.0574H\nRL=XL/QB=2182/50=44Ohm\n \nIfilt50=V0/XC50=105A\nQfilt50=3*Ifilt50*Ifilt50*XC50=73.3MVAr\nQfilt550=3*V0*V0/XC1=6.6MVAr
